Z||000000||Cozmo||11-08-2001||05:35 PM||||White, auto with no options except air.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/new88.jpg"> <BR>Good title, but it's been a "lawn ornament" for a few years.  No keys, broken drivers window, cracked windshield and the interior is trashed.  The car is straight with no rust and is only missing the front fascia and the engine grates. I don't have a clue how it runs yet, I've got to get the engine compartment open first.<BR>So now I'm up to 4...<BR>'85 2M6 SE Targa 4spd.<BR>'86 GT auto.<BR>'87 Coupe auto.<BR>'88 Coupe auto.<BR>All I need is an '84 and I've got one of every year...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"><BR>I guess I'm getting to be a Fiero addict...<BR>(as someone on the forum says, <B>please</B> don't help me).<BR><P>------------------<BR><B>BobC</B><BR><B>'85 2M6 Targa</B><BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/targsig.jpg"> <BR><B>Suncoast Fieros</B>||||reg||10
